      <definition>[=cuγlaraxu] v. i. and t. To gather, assemble; to wrap.</definition>
      <page>205</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠠᠭᠠᠰᠤᠨ ᠎ᠳᠤ ᠴᠣᠬᠯᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>caγasun du --xu</transcript>
          <definition>To wrap up in paper.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠺᠥᠯ ᠢᠶᠡᠨ ᠴᠣᠬᠯᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>køl ijen --xu</transcript>
          <definition>To bind or wrap one's feet.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠤᠷᠠᠯ ᠴᠣᠬᠯᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>xural --xu</transcript>
          <definition>For a meeting to convene.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠤᠷᠠᠯ ᠳ᠋‍‍ᠤ‍ᠷ ᠴᠣᠬᠯᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
